{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794761374948,"sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd5ffeS4J0KdMtC6TlEK","part":{"partID":"prt_1e01d32b4001UifOlbjkoaArs0","sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd5ffeS4J0KdMtC6TlEK","messageID":"msg_1e01d2a0c001BX457n9L92ggGH","type":"tool","id":"call_d45bfc70b3f04dcb8e3bc869","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/kill-switch-cli-5/iterations/iteration-001.md","oldString":"- The Python shim reads `DISABLE_ADVISOR_ENV` from `compat-contract.json` and compares it to the literal string `\"1\"` `[SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/skill_advisor.py:5491]`; the contract names `SPECKIT_SKILL_ADVISOR_HOOK_DISABLED` `[SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/skill_advisor.py:546-549]`.","newString":"- The Python shim reads `DISABLE_ADVISOR_ENV` from `compat-contract.json` and compares it to the literal string `\"1\"` `[SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/skill_advisor.py:5491]`; the contract names `SPECKIT_SKILL_ADVISOR_HOOK_DISABLED` `[SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/schemas/compat-contract.json:3]` and the shim binds it at `[SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/skill_advisor.py:210]`."},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/kill-switch-cli-5/iterations/iteration-001.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/kill-switch-cli-5/iterations/iteration-001.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/kill-switch-cli-5/iterations/iteration-001.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/kill-switch-cli-5/iterations/iteration-001.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/kill-switch-cli-5/iterations/iteration-001.md\n@@ -52,9 +52,9 @@\n \n ## Edge Cases\n \n - The resolver is fail-open when `hooks/shared/hook-flags.cjs` is absent: `ADVISOR_DISABLED_FLAGS` is empty and `advisorDisabledBy` returns null `[SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/advisor-disabled.ts:53-93]`. `ENV-REFERENCE.md:68` states the same fail-open rule for resolver failures. Recorded, not a finding: the runtime is repo-installed, so the resolver is present, and a missing resolver cannot widen a working switch.\n-- The Python shim reads `DISABLE_ADVISOR_ENV` from `compat-contract.json` and compares it to the literal string `\"1\"` `[SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/skill_advisor.py:5491]`; the contract names `SPECKIT_SKILL_ADVISOR_HOOK_DISABLED` `[SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/skill_advisor.py:546-549]`. CP-003's shim step uses exactly that name and value, so the scenario is reachable `[SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/compat-and-disable/global-disable-flag.md:52-56]`. A canonical-name-only shim invocation is out of this area's declared file scope; the docs question is carried to the traceability iteration.\n+- The Python shim reads `DISABLE_ADVISOR_ENV` from `compat-contract.json` and compares it to the literal string `\"1\"` `[SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/skill_advisor.py:5491]`; the contract names `SPECKIT_SKILL_ADVISOR_HOOK_DISABLED` `[SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/schemas/compat-contract.json:3]` and the shim binds it at `[SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/skill_advisor.py:210]`. CP-003's shim step uses exactly that name and value, so the scenario is reachable `[SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/compat-and-disable/global-disable-flag.md:52-56]`. A canonical-name-only shim invocation is out of this area's declared file scope; the docs question is carried to the traceability iteration.\n - The pass-five scope excludes `runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` and the Python shim, so their command-offer and shim behavior is context, not a finding. The brief's refusal/question/history/mention check is therefore limited to the switch paths this area owns; the offer module is noted as out of scope in Ruled Out rather than silently marked covered.\n \n ## Confirmed-Clean Surfaces\n \n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/kill-switch-cli-5/iterations/iteration-001.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/kill-switch-cli-5/iterations/iteration-001.md\",\"oldString\":\"- The Python shim reads `DISABLE_ADVISOR_ENV` from `compat-contract.json` and compares it to the literal string `\\\"1\\\"` `[SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/skill_advisor.py:5491]`; the contract names `SPECKIT_SKILL_ADVISOR_HOOK_DISABLED` `[SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/skill_advisor.py:546-549]`.\",\"newString\":\"- The Python shim reads `DISABLE_ADVISOR_ENV` from `compat-contract.json` and compares it to the literal string `\\\"1\\\"` `[SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/skill_advisor.py:5491]`; the contract names `SPECKIT_SKILL_ADVISOR_HOOK_DISABLED` `[SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/schemas/compat-contract.json:3]` and 