th never exercises those names',\n    file: '.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/skill-advisor-cli-stale-daemon-retry.vitest.ts:221',\n    dimension: 'maintainability',\n    findingClass: 'class-of-bug',\n    case: 'A change to env-aliases.cjs or the legacy alias list drops the MK_ bridge for the direct call; every test passes because the three MK_ names are filtered out of the only CLI loop that drives each alias.',\n    scopeProof: 'ADVISOR_DISABLED_FLAGS includes three MK_ names; the loop excludes every MK_ name; advisor-disabled.vitest.ts covers only two SYSTEM_/SPECKIT_ names; no test sets an MK_ name and asserts the CLI abstains.',\n    affectedSurfaceHints: ['skill-advisor-cli-stale-daemon-retry.vitest.ts disable loop', 'advisor-disabled.vitest.ts alias cases', 'env-aliases.cjs MK_ bridge'],\n    evidenceRefs: ['.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/skill-advisor-cli-stale-daemon-retry.vitest.ts:219-232', '.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/advisor-disabled.ts:74-81', '.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/advisor-disabled.vitest.ts:23-28', '.skilled/hooks/shared/env-aliases.cjs:20-49']\n  },\n  {\n    id: 'iter3-P2-lib-readme-tree',\n    severity: 'P2',\n    title: 'lib README tree omits five flat modules that exist on disk',\n    file: '.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/README.md:100',\n    dimension: 'maintainability',\n    findingClass: 'instance-only',\n    case: 'A maintainer uses the tree to see what exists and misses compiled-routing-flag.ts and private-skill-target.ts; the key-files table names df-idf.ts, route-exclusions.ts and caller-context.ts but the tree does not, so the two sections disagree with each other and with the directory.',\n    scopeProof: 'ls runtime/lib/*.ts returns caller-context.ts, compiled-routing-flag.ts, df-idf.ts, private-skill-target.ts and route-exclusions.ts; the tree lists none of the five and the key-files table lists three.',\n    affectedSurfaceHints: ['runtime/lib/README.md directory tree', 'runtime/lib/README.md key files table', 'runtime/lib'],\n    evidenceRefs: ['.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/README.md:100-122', '.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/README.md:138-140']\n  }\n];\nconst findingDetails = findings.map((f) => ({\n  id: f.id,\n  findingId: f.id,\n  severity: f.severity,\n  title: f.title,\n  file: f.file,\n  dimension: f.dimension,\n  findingClass: f.findingClass,\n  case: f.case,\n  scopeProof: f.scopeProof,\n  affectedSurfaceHints: f.affectedSurfaceHints,\n  evidenceRefs: f.evidenceRefs\n}));\nconst record = {\n  type: 'iteration',\n  iteration: 3,\n  mode: 'review',\n  target_agent: 'deep-review',\n  agent_definition_loaded: true,\n  resolved_route: 'Resolved route: mode=review target_agent=deep-review',\n  run: sessionId,\n  status: 'complete',\n  focus: 'maintainability-tests-and-module-map',\n  dimensions: ['maintainability'],\n  filesReviewed: [\n    '.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/launcher-bootstrap.vitest.ts:100-180',\n    '.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/skill-advisor-cli-stale-daemon-retry.vitest.ts:140-345',\n    '.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/advisor-disabled.vitest.ts:1-115',\n    '.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/handlers/advisor-recommend.vitest.ts:100-130,380-420',\n    '.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/skill-advisor-cli-test-utils.ts:51-96',\n    '.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/README.md:95-145',\n    '.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/ (directory listing)',\n    '.skilled/hooks/shared/hook-flags.cjs:331-350',\n    '.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/advisor-disabled.ts:74-81'\n  ],\n  findingsCount: findings.length,\n  findingsSummary: { P0: 0, P1: 0, P2: findings.length },\n  findingsNew: findings.map((f) => f.id),\n  findingDetails,\n  traceabilityChecks: {\n    spec_code: { status: 'pass', notes: 'Switch tests and module map read against the resolver name set and the actual lib directory.' },\n    checklist_evidence: { status: 'partial', notes: 'Switch tests and module map covered; holdout rule stays counts-only.' },\n    skill_agent: { status: 'notApplicable', notes: 'No agent definition changed in this area.' },\n    agent_cross_runtime: { status: 'notApplicable', notes: 'No runtime mirror changed in this area.' },\n    feature_catalog_code: { status: 'notApplicable', notes: 'Feature rows were checked in iteration 2 and no new claim was introduced.' },\n    playbook_capability: { status: 'pass', notes: 'CP-003 was checked in iteration 2; this iteration adds no playbook claim.' }\n  },\n  newFindingsRatio: 0.5,\n  noveltyJustification: 'Three new maintainability findings against six active P2s; all three are new in this pass and none repeats the pass-four offer or holdout findings.',\n  sessionId,\n  generation: 1,\n  lineageMode: 'new',\n  timestamp: now,\n  durationMs: 510000,\n  reviewDepthSchemaVersion: 2,\n  reviewDepthApplicability: {\n    scopeClass: 'standard',\n    enforcement: 'strict',\n    reason: 'Four switch test files, the shared test utils and the lib module map; test-quality and docs-vs-directory claims with concrete inputs.',\n    evidenceRefs: ['review-scope-5.txt:37-47', 'review-brief-5.txt:1']\n  },\n  targetSelection: {\n    selectedTargets: [\n      'runtime/tests/launcher-bootstrap.vitest.ts',\n      'runtime/tests/skill-advisor-cli-stale-daemon-retry.vitest.ts',\n      'runtime/tests/advisor-disabled.vitest.ts',\n      'runtime/tests/handlers/advisor-recommend.vitest.ts',\n      'runtime/tests/skill-advisor-cli-test-utils.ts',\n      'runtime/lib/README.md',\n      'runtime/lib/'\n    ],\n    selectionReason: 'The pass-five scope names the four switch test files and the shared test utils; the lib README is the module map that describes the area.',\n    discoveryMethods: ['direct_read', 'exact_search', 'directory_listing'],\n    omittedHighRiskTargets: ['prompt and holdout files (counts only)', 'command-attach.ts tests (out of pass-five scope)'],\n    graphStatus: 'unavailable',\n    semanticSearchStatus: 'unavailable',\n    evidenceRefs: ['review-scope-5.txt:29,37,40-47']\n  },\n  searchCoverage: {\n    requiredBugClasses: ['launcher_test_fixture_gap', 'mk_alias_test_gap', 'module_map_drift'],\n    covered: ['launcher_test_fixture_gap', 'mk_alias_test_gap', 'module_map_drift'],\n    ruledOut: [],\n    deferred: [],\n    blocked: [],\n    graphCoverageMode: 'graphless_fallback'\n  },\n  searchLedger: [\n    {\n      id: 'SL-208',\n      dimension: 'maintainability',\n      targetRefs: ['launcher-bootstrap.vitest.ts', 'advisor-disabled.ts', 'hook-flags.cjs'],\n      bugClass: 'launcher_test_fixture_gap',\n      hypothesis: 'The launcher switch test pins fewer names than the resolver honors.',\n      searchActions: [\n        { method: 'direct_read', queryOrPath: 'launcher-bootstrap.vitest.ts:124-145; advisor-disabled.ts:74-81; hook-flags.cjs:70-78', result: 'the fixture sets two names; the resolver list has ten', evidenceRefs: ['launcher-bootstrap.vitest.ts:127-145', 'advisor-disabled.ts:74-81'] }\n      ],\n      disposition: 'finding',\n      linkedFindingId: 'iter3-P2-launcher-switch-fixture',\n      rationale: 'Adding a switch name to the allowlist would pass the only launcher-boundary test.'\n    },\n    {\n      id: 'SL-209',\n      dimension: 'maintainability',\n      targetRefs: ['skill-advisor-cli-stale-daemon-retry.vitest.ts', 'advisor-disabled.vitest.ts'],\n      bugClass: 'mk_alias_test_gap',\n      hypothesis: 'The MK_ aliases are excluded from the only CLI alias loop and untested at the unit level.',\n      searchActions: [\n        { method: 'direct_read', queryOrPath: 'skill-advisor-cli-stale-daemon-retry.vitest.ts:219-232; advisor-disabled.vitest.ts:23-28', result: 'the loop filters MK_; the unit test covers two SYSTEM_/SPECKIT_ names', evidenceRefs: ['skill-advisor-cli-stale-daemon-r